INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(1526,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12479596','EEG Resting-state Microstate Dynamics in Children and Adolescents with Avoidant/Restrictive Food Intake Disorder (ARFID).','Bhadra K, Janakiram AA, Marco S, Micali N, Hüppi PS, Berchio C.','2025','subthreshold s10548 microstates aversions choking 2025a choking koomar dinkler bulimia solidified cerezo seetharaman nakai clow archibald waugh cara seetharaman getachew kerem sailer oversensitivity valence choking kerem hyperactivation sailer getachew millisecond berchio hestad topographies microstates microstates britz marqui microstates tarailis microstates britz custo seitzman subnetwork dmn tarailis microstates bochet damborska rieger thirioux microstates chivu 2025a ferat berchio inflexibility microstates microstates berchio interoceptive tack microstates dmn alimentation enfant alinea subthreshold sdq prosocial muris aversive wisc wais stai spielberger spielberger handedness ccer voucher geodesic geodesic impedances kohms optically acoustically electrically shielded butterworth berchio berchio berchio 2019a oculomotor interpolation sanity 2018b cartool brunet marqui bochet damborska initialization maxima cartool preprocessed brunet brunet gev gev milliseconds microstates intercorrelation sidak mauriello tanova topographies melie permutations bochet intercorrelation sidak sloreta marqui lsmac brunet mcin nist mni fonov cartool brunet sloreta cartool tzourio mazoyer decomposed newson thiagarajan hanning mtmfft 2018b randomizations wisc stai stai stai stai stai stai wisc gev topographies custo tanova microstates microstates gev sidak gev wisc wisc wisc dmn britz interoceptive sewaybricker wijngaarden dmn referential tarailis dmn uddin dmn dmn cerit tregellas dmn coutinho choking dmn deactivate microstates microstates britz tarailis multisensory willmott dmn dmn aversive antonova bagdasarov kleinert replicability wisc wisc hypothetically basile mahr overactivation dmn referential hyperac