Kurdoglu M, Ozgokce C, Cim N. Cases J. 2009;2:8485. doi: 10.4076/1757-1626-2-8485. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 18. Successful operative management of an intact second trimester abdominal pregnancy with additional preoperative selective catheter embolization and postoperative methotrexate therapy. Demendi C, Langmár Z, Bánhidy F, Börzsönyi B, Csatlós É, Joó JG. Med Sci Monit. 2011;17:0–5. doi: 10.12659/MSM.881752. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 19. Rectal ectopic pregnancy managed successfully by minimally invasive treatment using local methotrexate injection and systemic methotrexate administration: an extremely rare case at Tu Du hospital in Vietnam and literature review. Le DN, Nguyen PN. J Minim Invasive Gynecol. 2023;30:418–423. doi: 10.1016/j.jmig.2023.01.010. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 20. Retroperitoneal ectopic pregnancy: successful expectant management in condition of early pregnancy failure. Le DN, Nguyen PN, Huynh PH. BMC Pregnancy Childbirth. 2023;23:599. doi: 10.1186/s12884-023-05909-7. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ]',17,'2025-10-13 06:18:11','2025-10-13 06:18:11');
